          "text": "iti tṛtīyāvaraṇapūjām| tadbahiḥ pūrve oṃ saṅkarṣaṇāya namaḥ,\noṃ vāsudevāya namaḥ, āgneye oṃ pradyumnāya namaḥ,\ndakṣiṇe oṃ aniruddhāya namaḥ, oṃ puruṣottamāya namaḥ,\nnairṛtye oṃ adhokṣajāya namaḥ, paścime oṃ nārasiṃhāya namaḥ,\nom acyutāya namaḥ, vāyavye oṃ janārdanāya namaḥ,\nuttare oṃ upendrāya namaḥ, oṃ haraye namaḥ,\nīśānye śrīkṛṣṇāya namaḥ| iti caturthāvaraṇam|\n\ntadbahiḥ pūrve oṃ acyutāya namaḥ, oṃ kūrmāya namaḥ,\nāgneye oṃ varāhāya namaḥ, dakṣiṇe oṃ narasiṃhāya namaḥ,\noṃ vāmanāya namaḥ, nairṛtye oṃ paraśurāmāya namaḥ,\npaścime oṃ rāmāya namaḥ, oṃ kṛṣṇāya namaḥ,\nvāyavye oṃ buddhāya namaḥ, oṃ kalkine namaḥ,\noṃ anantāya namaḥ, aiśānye oṃ viśvarūpāya namaḥ|\niti pañcamāvaraṇam|\n\ntadbahiḥ pūrvādi dikṣu oṃ anantāya namaḥ,\noṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ, oṃ vāyave namaḥ, oṃ īśānāya namaḥ,\ndevasya agre oṃ garuḍāya namaḥ, āgneyādi dikṣu\noṃ vāmāruṇye namaḥ, oṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ,\noṃ bhāratyai namaḥ, oṃ girijāyai namaḥ,\ngaruḍasya vāme oṃ sauparṇe namaḥ| iti ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇam|\n\npūrve tadbahiḥ pūrvādi aṣṭadikṣu oṃ vāmendrāya,\nsurādipataye, śacīsahitāya, sāyudhāya, savāhanāya|\nsaparigrahāya śrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\nagnaye oṃ rām, agnaye tejo’dhipataye svāhā|\nsahitāya sāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\ndakṣiṇe oṃ yaṃ yamāya dharmādhipataye śyāmalā sahitāya\nsāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\nnairṛtye oṃ kṣāṃ nirṛtaye rakṣo’dhipataye dhīrgragrīvā\nsahitāya sāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\npaścime oṃ vaṃ varuṇāya jalādhipataye gaṅgā sahitāya\nsāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\nvāyavye oṃ vaṃ vāyave jñānādhipataye bhāratī sahitāya\nsāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha sa pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\nuttare oṃ saṃ somāya dhanādhipataye rohiṇī sahitāya\nsāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ|\n\nīśānye oṃ hāṃ rudrāya bhūtādhipataye umā sahitāya\nsāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya...\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ.\n\nnirṛti varuṇayormadhye oṃ āṃ śeṣāya nāgādhipataye\nnāgiṇī sahitāya sāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ.\n\nindra īśānayormadhye oṃ hrīṃ brahmaṇe satyalokādhipataye\ngāyatrī sahitāya sāyudhāya savāhanāya saparigrahāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābha pārṣadāya namaḥ.\n\ntanmadhye ekībhūtasvāvatārāya strīkāya saparivārāya\nśrīmadanantapadmanābhāya namaḥ.\n\n",
