          "text": "yāce'haṃ tvā ṛṣikeśa anapāpi puruṣottama|\nhṛdi me kuru saṃvāsaṃ śriyā saha jagatpate|\njitaṃ te puṇḍarīkākṣa pūrvaṣāḍguṇyavigraha|\nparānanda parabrahman namaste caturātmane|\nnamaste pītavasana namaḥ kaṭakadhāriṇe|\nnamo nīlālakābaddhaveṇī sundarapuṅgava|\nyāce'haṃ karuṇāsindho yāvajjīvam idaṃ tava|\nadainyaṃ deha dārḍhyaṃ me tatpādāmbujasadratīm|\n\n",
